@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor LOGIC_COLOR_T4

start
:Parse name keywords;
:Parse role-title keywords;
:Parse candidate statuses;
if (All criteria empty?) then (yes)
  :Show all candidates;
else (no)
  :Evaluate each candidate;
  if (Name keyword matches?) then (yes)
    :Keep candidate;
  elseif (Role-title keyword matches?) then (yes)
    :Keep candidate;
  elseif (Candidate status is selected?) then (yes)
    :Keep candidate;
  else (no)
    :Remove candidate from visible list;
  endif
endif
:Visible indices are regenerated;
stop

note right
Within a field, alternatives use OR.
Across name, role-title and candidate-status
fields, the implementation also uses OR.
There is currently no role-status criterion
in the find command; role status is shown and
managed in the separate role list.
end note
@enduml
